OL,3,GNEWSAEverything you need to know about
OL,4,AHull Fair
OL,5,
OL,6,FHull Fair returns on Friday, bringing
OL,7,Fwith it striking neon lights, the waft
OL,8,Fof burgers and excited screams from
OL,9,Fthousands of thrill-seekers.
OL,11,FBased in Walton Street, the
OL,12,Fcenturies-old annual event was
OL,13,Festablished in 1278 and is one of the
OL,14,Flargest travelling fairs in Europe.
OL,16,FOrganisers said more than 300 rides
OL,17,Fawait visitors.
OL,19,FThe fair is due to open at 16:00 BST
OL,20,Fand it will run until 17 October.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
